# Design Blueprint

The Blackwell Field-Intelligence Engine is built on the principle that
intelligence emerges from architecture, not from neurons or computation.

This engine models:

- DNA as a generator of laws  
- Laws as generators of field dynamics  
- Field dynamics as generators of Field Intelligence  
- Field Intelligence as a force shaping DNA and laws  

This creates a self-referential, self-evolving system capable of
discovering high-intelligence kernels such as Armillaria.